\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. It is destined for man to die,\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 For, all flesh are to decay.
\par All living beings that are on earth
\par Shall die and rise up again.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This carnal body shall decay,
\par And it will resurrect again.
\par In the last days of glory.
\par Will be the fate of the saints.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. For this reason the Lord will save
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 The lives of men in due course,
\par Never shall I be in sadness
\par My end time not to worry,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The suffering my Jesus tasted,
\par Has saved me totally from death.
\par I am consoled by my death,
\par I greatly rejoice in it
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. It is Christ who first died for me,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And I deem it as a gain;
\par I have enjoyed His salvation,
\par So I will then die in joy,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I will leave this world of troubles
\par To dwell with our Lord in Heaven.
\par There I shall ever see Him;
\par All troubles shall pass away.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  That's where the joy of life is found
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 That's where thousands of people
\par Have reached and have congregated.
\par They're before the throne of God.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His glory shines through Seraphim.
\par Where they sing melodiously thus:
\par Holy, Holy, Holy for
\par Father, Son, and Holy Ghost.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Oh Jerusalem good nation,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Thy brightness pleasing to me.
\par They sing unto thee with great joy,
\par And it sounds so peacefully.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\ulnone\b0 
\par In great joy overwhelmingly\cf0 
\par Is manifested as the sun
\par Yes, now that it is daybreak,
\par Eternal, Eternal light.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Behold, I perceive great glory
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Long before I receive it.
\par That heavenly shinning garment,
\par In which I will be adorned.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I will wear that crown of pure gold
\par And I shall stand before my Lord.
\par I shall surely get that joy
\par \pard      Which shall never never end\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

